<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MAINLY FLAT AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MAINLY FLAT AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>mainly unchanged at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Thursday. The three-month rate was flat at 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>			   April 17 fix	   April 16 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	    3.01 pct	     3.02 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	    3.04 pct	     3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	    3.07 pct	     3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	    3.20 pct	     3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	    3.32 pct	     3.33 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	   3.46 pct	     3.46 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
